{"schemaVersion":2,"release":"pilot-30-0","kind":"dictionary-translations","data":{"n:00307455":{"examples":{"there is standing room only on the high-speed commute":"在这趟高速通勤列车上，只剩站立的空间。"}},"v:02071457":{"examples":{"The rain water drains into this big vat":"雨水排进这个大桶。"}},"v:01482449":{"examples":{"pack the books into the boxes":"把书装进箱子里。"}},"n:13451804":{"examples":{"the consumption of energy has increased steadily":"能源消耗持续增加。"}},"v:02700867":{"examples":{"The jar carries wine":"罐子里装着酒。","The canteen holds fresh water":"水壶里装着淡水。","This can contains water":"这个罐子里有水。"}},"v:02296153":{"examples":{"give a secret to the Russians":"把一个秘密告知俄国人","leave your name and address here":"在这里留下你的姓名和地址","impart a new skill to the students":"传授学生一项新技能"}},"r:00008600":{"examples":{"was entirely to blame":"应当负全部责任","a school devoted entirely to the needs of problem children":"一所专门满足有困难儿童需要的学校","he works for Mr. Smith exclusively":"他只为史密斯先生工作。","did it solely for money":"这么做仅仅是为了钱","the burden of proof rests on the prosecution alone":"举证责任只在控方","a privilege granted only to him":"只授予他的特权"}},"a:01861205":{"examples":{"the public good":"公共利益","public libraries":"公共图书馆","public funds":"公共资金","public parks":"公共公园","a public scandal":"引起公众关注的丑闻","public gardens":"公共花园","performers and members of royal families are public figures":"表演者和王室成员属于公众人物。"}}},"resources":[]}
